    <Description>Bryan Fury Sample combo 3(Left Side)
This macro is designed to perform combos in a game called Tekken 7 with a single button. 
To do this technique, you need to be to the left of your opponent and the control should be set by default with the shift settings like mine:
1= U
2=I
3=J
4=k
The macro has been tested in numerous online battles. Problems can only be due to your unstable Internet connection with the enemy, as well as this macro works only at a stable frame rate of 59-60 fps.
</Description>
